{"id":"steam-1046590","steam":1046590,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Antodon Express","summary":"In this first-person horror game you use your minecart to explore an ore mine infested with giant ants and upgrade it to defeat their supreme mutant ant leader Antodon.","about":"Search for a \"Primordial Relic\" that's at the bottom of an abandoned ore mine. The mine is infested with giant ants, who have a leader - a mutant titan who doesn't like visitors. Good luck.\n\nExplore the Mine in Your Minecart\n\nUse a motorized minecart to travel through the mine. Going fast makes a lot of noise and you run the risk of making a wrong turn...\r\n\nOutsmart or Abuse the Ants\n\nAnts will use various paths within caves to access and mine the gems. Figure out a way to stop them so you can mine the gems yourself.. or use dynamite.\r\n \n\n\r\nUpgrade the Minecart\n\nUse the gems to fuel the minecart booster or visit the Merchant to buy items and upgrades\r\n \r\n\nDefeat Antodon in the Ultimate Minecart Chase\n\nYou'll need the upgrades because Antodon has his own minecart powered by pure ancient evil and he will not stop until you are derailed.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/3b844c93680b45d0499d0017685a44ee1d03a14b/library_600x900.jpg?t=1788004350","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/header.jpg?t=1788004350","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/740ec446bed8503eef62c87e8c0116b67f2b4774/library_hero.jpg?t=1788004350","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/header.jpg?t=1788004350","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/ss_34a8ad7a11c8eb60d7e77f919829b705abdf7eeb.600x338.jpg?t=1788004350","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/ss_34a8ad7a11c8eb60d7e77f919829b